  "subtitle": "West African tomato rice cooked in a rich pepper base",
  "excerpt": "Rice cooked directly in a blended tomato and pepper sauce until each grain is stained deep red and smoky at the bottom. The prized crust at the base of the pot is called party jollof. One pot, big flavour.",
